# VELLUM core

- This repository is VELLUM OS only. Never open, copy, or depend on STRIX.
- Build mode is greenfield. Do not restore historical SHAs or treat old Phase 0 tags as done.
- Judge features against CAPTURE, PROCESSING, INTELLIGENCE, FINDING, HUMAN REVIEW, DECISION, ACTION, REINSPECTION, VERIFICATION, RESULT.
- Follow ADRs and docs/product/VELLUM_V3_FINAL_SPEC.md. Do not widen scope without evidence.
- A gate status requires evidence. Never fabricate PASS.
- Phase 0 code, scaffolds, installs, and migrations require a separate human authorization.
